  "description": "The Bolt is made to go very fast! Built around a lightweight welded Cromoly steel frame and alluminium fork, paired with an 8 or 7 speed Shimano Nexus internal geared hub and a belt drive system that is clean and service free. A Creme saddle and gummy Creme grips with alluminium bar ends look elegant and are a pleasure to touch. Thick stays and leather washers keep mud guards stable and silent. A stainless steel front rack is super practical for carrying luggage. Finished in a high-end multi layer matte paint with a powder clear coat in Carbon Gray. Safety at night thanks to dynamo LED lights. The Bolt ST is also available with a step-through version, ideal for shorter people. These classic-looking bicycles are the perfect choice for your everyday commute.",
